      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Time Change Notice For Oratorio Rehearsal"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-8273239e501fb162"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "To all members of the Goliards Chorus:"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-21a614540d0a5f75"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The rehearsal for next Tuesday has been rescheduled due to the Golden Theater heating device maintenance. The adjustment details are as follows:"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-888c382eef430489"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. The chorus rehearsal, originally scheduled to start at 9:30 on Tuesday, has been changed to 13:30 due to maintenance. Lunch will not be provided for this rehearsal."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-60d947505e538688"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "2. The orchestra will not participate in this rehearsal because all instruments have been moved for maintenance. Please wait for further notices."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-6f7714a22ff644c8"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "3. Due to soprano Tatiana's accidental injury and hospitalization, soprano Celine will be taking her parts in the play."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-92cc50d2887cb743"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "4. As the date for the official performance draws near, rehearsal time will be extended by three to four hours. The theater has arranged for transportation to ensure all members reach home safely. For those that live far from the theater, you may apply for accommodations at the Goethe Hotel."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-87c73147df7ade48"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Please inform each other, make sure everyone has read the notice, and make the proper arrangements accordingly."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-ff774c313e9a4610"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Goliards Chorus Administrative Committee"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "November 22, 699 AF"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-2ffc2e8754696ad5"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
